#
# writ_bend_monitor_accept.run - Genode run script (build configuration),
# not Writ implementation. Genode channel lane, Task 2, run 1. The client
# writ_client_r, routed by init as reader R (policy subject 1), writes the
# report-to-summary request for R's negotiated session (monitor session 1,
# expected revision 6) and claims its own subject in the body (1). Expected:
# Committed (decision 1, reason 0), decided by Bend through
# DataOS.commit_from_capability. The client first sleeps 2000 ms, so the
# monitor's Genode.take is parked when the request signal arrives (run 2
# sends at once). Exits nonzero when that changes.
# The shared procedure is scripts/genode/writ_bend_monitor/writ_bend_monitor.tcl.
#
source [select_from_repositories run/writ_bend_monitor.tcl]

writ_bend_monitor_run writ_client_r 1 1 6 1 1 0 2000
